Lemma reg_at : forall E' regs R' (n : nat) (x : reg), regs_ok E' regs R' -> ridx x = n -> bv_eqb x 0 = false -> getr R' x = edenot E' (nth n regs (ELit 0)).
Proof. ltac2:(Rpl.RP.run_i (rplG ()) 0 "S60!1,M|21;!1+N!1,M|600;!2'V#8!2'W#7#4!1,6,S!2'V#9!4'X+0#6#83!2'V#8!4'X+0#5#73$E';R+J$regs;R!1+K+0$R';R!2'L01$n;R+:$x;R!1+N0$HR;R!3'O#5#4#3$Hn;R!3+2+:!1'P#2#3$Hx;R!3+2+G!3'Q0#3!3,R0,Svv,?!2'T0,S,U!6'812$b;R1!3+21#14vd!6'8+G,U$b;R+G!3+21!2'V#9-GRN$~R+G+0#123!4'X+0!1'P#5#834!6'8+:#5$n;R+:!3+21!2'V#9!4'X+0#1#834!2,915!1'P#4#2!3'Q0#4!3,R0,S,?#1!3+2125!2'Y#6#4!1#3#4").
Qed.

